    "references": [
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 0",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 0,
          "component_id": "747476f7-e804-5a33-8995-ddff261291d0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 331,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "“Day care” means providing various levels of some or all of the following care as well as those services generally so associated, to individuals for less than 24 hours a day: food and dietetic services; transportation, social, recreational, educational and activity arrangements; watchful and protective oversight; and supervision.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "295cbee3-6ccf-5f8d-b900-b2aa98203416",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 740,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:1",
          "start": 332
        },
        "quote": "“Day care facility, type I” means a structure inhabited as a dwelling unit or portion thereof, and premises, operated and licensed in accordance with any and all applicable State and local requirements and conducted in the resident’s dwelling unit in which care is provided for profit or not for profit, to children and/or adults on a regular schedule for less than 24 hours a day to a maximum of 12 persons.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b90314c7-5939-5572-9a5f-18592d352fb2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1274,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:2",
          "start": 741
        },
        "quote": "“Day care facility, type II” means a structure or portion thereof, and premises, operated and licensed in accordance with any and all applicable State and local requirements, in which care is provided for profit or not for profit, to children and/or adults on a regular schedule for less than 24 hours a day, and which may be operated as a secondary and/or ancillary use to a primary or principal use, such as, but not limited to, a place of worship, community center, library, or private business, and associated with that activity.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "43513046-6ba6-5f71-b90b-a068adaf5471",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1323,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:3",
          "start": 1275
        },
        "quote": "Demolition Landfill. See “landfill, demolition.”",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "112b8a9b-e60a-50ff-89d7-9332e51c90b7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1378,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:4",
          "start": 1324
        },
        "quote": "“Density” means the number of dwelling units per acre.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "97404b90-b2d0-5b66-82b0-ab298882f0fe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1626,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:5",
          "start": 1379
        },
        "quote": "“Developer” means the legal or beneficial owner or owners of a lot or of any land included in a proposed development including the holder of an option or contract to purchase, or other persons having enforceable proprietary interests in such land.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "7131268a-625d-5952-9f40-3537997e1178",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1916,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:6",
          "start": 1627
        },
        "quote": "“Development” means the division of a parcel of land into two or more parcels; the construction, reconstruction, conversion, structural alteration, relocation or enlargement of any structure; any mining, excavation, landfill or land disturbance and any use or extension of the use of land.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "4126f34e-9ddc-5159-9a7e-2aa422bfd5eb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1987,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:7",
          "start": 1917
        },
        "quote": "“Director” means the Director of Planning and Development or designee.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "fa6baebf-5109-5113-9f18-4966f68a10e1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2046,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:8",
          "start": 1988
        },
        "quote": "“Disability (or handicap)” with respect to a person means:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "06e1aaf8-c9c3-51e3-ac72-3b78f17c4932",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2161,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:9",
          "start": 2047
        },
        "quote": "(1) A physical or mental impairment which substantially limits one or more of such person’s major life activities;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "45fbe780-7bcd-52ac-9ac1-353b4e214124",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2207,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:10",
          "start": 2162
        },
        "quote": "(2) A record of having such an impairment; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "9c4f0cc3-a827-5628-a97b-31a0f8ebc20e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2256,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:11",
          "start": 2208
        },
        "quote": "(3) Being regarded as having such an impairment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "cb6fd212-de15-55f9-b18a-0efa0c500d10",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2429,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:12",
          "start": 2257
        },
        "quote": "Such term does not include current, illegal use or addiction to a controlled substance, as defined in Section 102 of the Controlled Substance Act ( 21 U.S.C. Section 802 ).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "3b834f01-aeb1-5d13-b97e-12df244a1b79",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2597,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:13",
          "start": 2430
        },
        "quote": "“District” means any section of the jurisdiction for which the regulations governing the use of buildings and premises or the height and area of buildings are uniform.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "ec5a7108-c16d-5ed7-8ece-f45a9dc7a71a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2905,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:14",
          "start": 2598
        },
        "quote": "“District map” means the boundaries of the zoning districts as they presently exist or as they may from time to time be amended as shown upon the district map on file in the office of the Planning Director, which boundaries shall have the same force and effect as though fully set forth or described herein.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "3192cb62-c95f-52cd-9b59-cae7e8dc5a95",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3077,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:15",
          "start": 2906
        },
        "quote": "“Domestic animal” means small animals that are customarily kept for personal use or enjoyment such as, but not limited to, dogs, cats, tropical birds, rabbits and rodents.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "3452457d-64ac-540a-8d8f-08223a044aa1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3357,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:16",
          "start": 3078
        },
        "quote": "“Dormitory” means a building or part of a building operated by an institution and containing a room or rooms forming one or more habitable units which are used or intended to be used by residents of the institution for living and sleeping, but not for cooking or eating purposes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "73ebfee7-c3d3-55e7-b5e1-59848c1c2444",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3494,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:17",
          "start": 3358
        },
        "quote": "“Drinking establishment” means premises which may be open to the general public, where alcoholic liquor by the individual drink is sold.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "62ef2d1d-3207-517b-aa25-39ad6b8a73b4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3583,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:18",
          "start": 3495
        },
        "quote": "“Driveway” means a paved surface designed to provide vehicular access to a parking area.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "34c7fcde-085b-5ac5-8b1c-a135dc6dfb54",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3823,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:19",
          "start": 3584
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling” means a building or portion thereof, used exclusively for residential occupancy, including one-family, two-family and multiple-family dwellings, but not including hotels, motels, boarding houses, house trailers and mobile homes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "4fa1a2f2-2a5e-5565-8329-eed5617c5c40",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3943,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:20",
          "start": 3824
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, attached” means a one-family dwelling attached to two or more one-family dwellings by common vertical walls.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "05b2ff1f-8c26-56eb-b01b-949c891d8b3d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4102,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:21",
          "start": 3944
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, detached” means a dwelling which is designed to be and is substantially separate from any other structure or structures except accessory buildings.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "70df2552-7730-5ae1-8647-cd3d5cf933cd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4344,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:22",
          "start": 4103
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, multiple-family” means a building or portion thereof used for occupancy by three or more families living independently of each other, and doing their own cooking in the building, including apartments, group houses, and row houses.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "1a004275-1589-5d5f-a61b-114e52ec6675",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4550,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:23",
          "start": 4345
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, row house or townhouse” means one of a series of three or more attached dwelling units separated from one another by continuous vertical party walls without openings from basement floor to roof.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "63fcb8ed-d473-5ecd-8853-c5eb963fa647",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4858,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:24",
          "start": 4551
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, single-family” means a building designed and/or used exclusively for residential purposes for one family only and containing not more than one unit, including site-built homes and residential-design manufactured homes, but not including house trailers and mobile homes as defined by this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "93526411-3617-5e66-8195-4818ee73391f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5096,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:25",
          "start": 4859
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, single-family attached” means a one-family dwelling attached to one other one-family dwelling by a common vertical wall that is unpierced and located along its common property line, and each dwelling located on a separate lot.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "034f5e2a-28f2-5fa2-a5ca-220e6b389369",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5311,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:26",
          "start": 5097
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, single-family detached” means a dwelling which is designed for and occupied by not more than one family and surrounded by open space or yards and which is not attached to any other dwelling by any means.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.55.040 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "bc34729f-e1a5-576e-bdc2-0b1a87cef8b6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5653,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:27",
          "start": 5312
        },
        "quote": "“Dwelling, two-family (duplex)” means a structure on a single lot containing two dwelling units, each of which is totally separated from the other by an unpierced wall extending from ground to roof or an unpierced ceiling and floor extending from exterior wall to exterior wall, except for a common stairwell exterior to both dwelling units.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:27#text",
